        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b78e4883-e406-3204-b9ff-7a64fab93a69",
                "word": "chiliaste",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "aa3d7906-6635-413c-a3f8-c3e8728bbbed",
                        "entry_id": "b78e4883-e406-3204-b9ff-7a64fab93a69",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chiliastes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f72bc100-dad4-3eb0-97eb-99cf2fa2975c",
                        "entry_id": "b78e4883-e406-3204-b9ff-7a64fab93a69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif au chiliasme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32f90c82-bde2-4cf6-9a1e-c66642f712fe",
                                "sense_id": "f72bc100-dad4-3eb0-97eb-99cf2fa2975c",
                                "text": "L’utopie chiliaste fait naître des contre-utopies, qui sont plus ou moins dirigées contre la menace d’une résurgence de cette utopie fondamentale."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "937992cf-ace2-32db-b417-49924f450943",
                        "entry_id": "b78e4883-e406-3204-b9ff-7a64fab93a69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Partisan du chiliasme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7d47f8d-7818-4edc-8e36-0e0e01b468ba",
                                "sense_id": "937992cf-ace2-32db-b417-49924f450943",
                                "text": "Nous nous attacherons donc surtout aux éclats soudains, aux violences excessives, aux utopies sanglantes et aux promptes débandades, les unes et les autres ayant pu toutefois s'inscrire comme une séquence particulière dans le film d'actions plus cohérentes d'opposition : ainsi les comportements aberrants des chiliastes de Bohême à l'intérieur du camp taborite en 1419-1421."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb6388d6-689f-4ce1-b2cb-fa27fc1386bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "b78e4883-e406-3204-b9ff-7a64fab93a69",
                        "target_lang_word": "chiliastic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chiliastic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bd53b23-6007-3bd1-baf7-57d08fc0bcf8",
                                        "entry_id": "474b6840-6c41-3970-aa14-4bffae8ca8f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the religious doctrine of a thousand-year period of peace and prosperity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dd6efe2-3102-42c3-8a3e-ef181e76ccad",
                                                "sense_id": "5bd53b23-6007-3bd1-baf7-57d08fc0bcf8",
                                                "text": "The social anthropologist can recognise in the millenarian sentiments of the Interregnum a parallel phenomenon to the chiliastic movements which still occur in the underdeveloped countries of today."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1233927-7765-4b58-a837-808fd5f1975a",
                                                "sense_id": "5bd53b23-6007-3bd1-baf7-57d08fc0bcf8",
                                                "text": "The evanescent quality of Debord's later writing, his chiliastic serenity, is patent here: a voice speaking from a world one might want to make and then to live in, but also the voice of the mad professor in Eric Ambler's spy thriller Cause for Alarm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00a823c6-cddd-437e-80a6-42d8d77bdfcd",
                                                "sense_id": "5bd53b23-6007-3bd1-baf7-57d08fc0bcf8",
                                                "text": "Yet, as Gary Weiss shows in his new book, Ayn Rand Nation, she has become to the new right what Karl Marx once was to the left: a demigod at the head of a chiliastic cult."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f89dae5-585b-4b91-8188-f4a63cd45a6f",
                                                "sense_id": "5bd53b23-6007-3bd1-baf7-57d08fc0bcf8",
                                                "text": "In his pioneering study The Pursuit of the Millennium (1957), Norman Cohn showed how Nazism was also a chiliastic movement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": [
                    {
                        "linkage_id": "541d9d45-2e58-4a86-a13b-f8a0ff29d31d",
                        "source_entry_id": "b78e4883-e406-3204-b9ff-7a64fab93a69",
                        "source_sense_ids": [],
                        "linkage_type": "synonyms",
                        "word": "millénariste"
                    },
